       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.        TRELRPT.
       AUTHOR.            CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.      FEBRUARY 1996.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.      THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *D   T R E L R P T                                               *
      *D                                                               *
      *D     THIS PROGRAM READS THROUGH THE SHIPPING RELEASE AUDIT     *
      *D     FILE (MCPFCS6100) AND PRINTS OUT THE RECORDS.  A          *
      *D     PARAMETER MAY BE PASSED TO START THE REPORT WITH A        *
      *D     PARTICULAR DATE.  IT IS CALLED FROM TRELINQ USING JOB     *
      *D     JOB BRELTOP/BRELBOT.                                      *
      *D                                                               *
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *  C H A N G E S :                                               *
      *                                                                *
      *C                                                               *
      *C 12/10/1997  CA YODER                                          *
      *C   Y2K TESTING FOUND THAT EUROPEAN DATE NOT HANDLED PROPERLY   *
      *C   IN THIS PROGRAM.  CORRECTED PROBLEM WITH TDATECHK.          *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DRELTRAK-I
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-MCFLCS6101
               ORGANIZATION  IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE   IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY    IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT REPORT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DRELTRAK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRELTRAK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS6100  OF MCFLCS6101.

       FD  REPORT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS REPORT-FILE-REC.
       01  REPORT-FILE-REC      PIC X(132).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 137 CHARACTERS.
       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SORT-KEY-1       PIC X(14).
           05  FILLER           PIC X(36).
           05  SORT-KEY-2       PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER           PIC X(12).
           05  FILLER           PIC S9(8)V9(4).
           05  FILLER           PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER           PIC S9(11)V9(4)  COMP-3.
           05  FILLER           PIC X(23).
           05  FILLER           PIC S9(11)V9(4)  COMP-3.
           05  FILLER           PIC X(12).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *             D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY DRELTRAK   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                    H O L D   A R E A S                         *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  PAGE-NUM                      PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01  NUM-LINES                     PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X    VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X    VALUE "0".

       01  DRELTRAK-EOF-SW               PIC X    VALUE "N".
       01  SORT-EOF-SW                   PIC X    VALUE "N".

       01  DATE-ARG.
           05  ARG-CC                    PIC X(2).
           05  ARG-YMD.
               10  ARG-YY                PIC X(2).
               10  ARG-MM                PIC X(2).
               10  ARG-DD                PIC X(2).

       01  CURRENT-DATE                    VALUE SPACES.
           05  CUR-YY             PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-YY-9   REDEFINES  CUR-YY  PIC 9(2).
           05  CUR-MM             PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-MM-9   REDEFINES  CUR-MM  PIC 9(2).
           05  CUR-DD             PIC X(2).

       01  CURRENT-TIME                    VALUE SPACES.
           05  CUR-HR             PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-MIN            PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-SEC            PIC X(2).

       01  MONTH-ENTRIES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE " JANUARY ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE " FEBRUARY".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "  MARCH  ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "  APRIL  ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "   MAY   ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "   JUNE  ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "   JULY  ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "  AUGUST ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE "SEPTEMBER".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE " OCTOBER ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE " NOVEMBER".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE " DECEMBER".

       01  MONTH-TABLE REDEFINES MONTH-ENTRIES.
           05  MONTH-VALUE  OCCURS 12 TIMES  PIC X(9).

      *------ PARAMETERS PASSED TO PROGRAM.
      *------ IF REPORT-TYPE = M  THEN  PRINT MONTHLY REPORT.
      *------                = O  THEN  PRINT ON-LINE REPORT STARTING
      *------                           WITH A PARTICULAR DATE ENTERED
      *------                           ON SCREEN.
       01  DATA-LINE.
           05  REPORT-TYPE         PIC X.
           05  REPORT-ST-DATE      PIC X(8).
           05  REPORT-NAME         PIC X(20).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               R E P O R T   L I N E S                          *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  ROUTE-1.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(35) VALUE ALL "*".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(92) VALUE SPACES.

       01  ROUTE-2.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(35) VALUE
               "*                                 *".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(92) VALUE SPACES.

       01  ROUTE-3.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(35) VALUE
               "*  PLEASE ROUTE THIS REPORT TO:   *".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(92) VALUE SPACES.

       01  ROUTE-4.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(8)  VALUE "*       ".
           05  R4-NAME            PIC X(20).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7)  VALUE "      *".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(92) VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADING-1.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  H1-DATE            PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(56) VALUE
             "SHIPPING RELEASES CREATED WITHOUT LOW-COST VENDOR REPORT".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7)  VALUE "TRELRPT".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADING-2.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  H2-HR              PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X     VALUE ":".
           05  H2-MIN             PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X     VALUE ":".
           05  H2-SEC             PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(39) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MONTHLY-HDG.
               10  FILLER         PIC X(7).
               10  H2-MONTH       PIC X(9).
               10  FILLER         PIC X.
               10  H2-CENT        PIC X(2).
               10  H2-YEAR        PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER         PIC X(7).
           05  INQUIRY-HDG  REDEFINES  MONTHLY-HDG.
               10  FILLER         PIC X(3).
               10  H2-LIT         PIC X(15).
               10  H2-DATE        PIC X(8).
               10  FILLER         PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(39) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE "PAGE ".
           05  H2-PAGE-NUM        PIC ZZ9.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADING-3.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(10) VALUE
                                   "PO NUMBER/".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(21) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(4)  VALUE "    ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(43) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(41) VALUE
                        "---------------- LOWEST -----------------".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADING-4.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(4)  VALUE "RLSE".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(9)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "ITEM  CODE        DATE    ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "USER         PRICE      UM".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "  VENDOR     PO NUM   ITEM".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "      PRICE     UM  VENDOR".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADING-5.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(11) VALUE "-----------".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "----  --------  --------  ".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "--------  ------------  --".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(26) VALUE
                                   "  --------   -------  ----".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(28) VALUE
                                   "  ------------  --  --------".
           05  FILLER             PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  DETAIL-LINE.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(7).
           05  DET-PO             PIC X(7).
           05  HYPH-1             PIC X.
           05  DET-RLSE           PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-ITEM           PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-CODE           PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-DATE           PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-USER           PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-PRICE          PIC Z(6)9.9999.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-UM             PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-VENDOR         PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(3).
           05  DET-LOW-PO         PIC X(7).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-LOW-ITEM       PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-LOW-PRICE      PIC Z(6)9.9999.
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-LOW-UM         PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(2).
           05  DET-LOW-VENDOR     PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER             PIC X(6).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               U T I L I T Y   A R E A                          *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB      IN COPYLIB.


      *--------- P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N ------------------*

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAINLINE SECTION.
       0-MAINLINE-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           SORT SORT-FILE
               ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-KEY-2
                                SORT-KEY-1
               INPUT  PROCEDURE IS 7-PROCESS-DRELTRAK
               OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 8-PRINT-REPORT.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT  DRELTRAK-I
                OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.

           INITIALIZE DATA-LINE.
           ACCEPT DATA-LINE.
           ACCEPT CURRENT-DATE FROM DATE.
           ACCEPT CURRENT-TIME FROM TIME.

           MOVE 1            TO  DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT   TO  H1-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-HR       TO  H2-HR.
           MOVE CUR-MIN      TO  H2-MIN.
           MOVE CUR-SEC      TO  H2-SEC.

      *------- IF IT'S THE MONTHLY REPORT, PRINT THE MONTH.  OTHERWISE,
      *------- PRINT THE STARTING DATE OF THE REPORT.
           IF REPORT-TYPE = "M"
               PERFORM 10-MONTHLY-HEADING
           ELSE
               PERFORM 11-ONLINE-HEADING.

           PERFORM 12-ROUTING-INFO.

           PERFORM 8-62-PRINT-HEADINGS.

       10-MONTHLY-HEADING.
           MOVE SPACES              TO  MONTHLY-HDG.
           SUBTRACT 1             FROM  CUR-MM-9.
           IF CUR-MM-9 < 1
               MOVE 12              TO  CUR-MM-9
               SUBTRACT 1         FROM  CUR-YY-9.
           MOVE CUR-MM              TO  ARG-MM.
           MOVE 01                  TO  ARG-DD.
           MOVE CUR-YY-9            TO  H2-YEAR
                                        ARG-YY.
           IF CUR-YY < "90"
               MOVE "20"            TO  H2-CENT
                                        ARG-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "19"            TO  H2-CENT
                                        ARG-CC.
           MOVE MONTH-VALUE (CUR-MM-9)   TO  H2-MONTH.

       11-ONLINE-HEADING.
           MOVE SPACES              TO  INQUIRY-HDG.
           IF REPORT-ST-DATE > 0
               MOVE REPORT-ST-DATE      TO  DATE-ARG
               MOVE "STARTING DATE: "   TO  H2-LIT
               MOVE 4                   TO  DATE-MODE
               MOVE ARG-YMD             TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT      TO  H2-DATE
           ELSE
               MOVE "  *** COMPLETE LISTING ***  "
                                        TO  INQUIRY-HDG.

       12-ROUTING-INFO.
           MOVE REPORT-NAME             TO  R4-NAME.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-1 AFTER ADVANCING PAGE.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-3 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-4 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM ROUTE-1 AFTER ADVANCING 1.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE       DRELTRAK-I
                       REPORT-FILE.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                I N P U T   P R O C E D U R E                   *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       7-PROCESS-DRELTRAK SECTION.
       7-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 7-1-HSK.
           PERFORM 7-6-PROCESS-A-REC
               UNTIL DRELTRAK-EOF-SW = "Y".
           GO TO 7-PROCESS-DRELTRAK-X.

       7-1-HSK.
           MOVE DATE-ARG TO DATECYMD OF DRELTRAK-REC-I.
           START DRELTRAK-I KEY >= DATECYMD OF DRELTRAK-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "Y"             TO  DRELTRAK-EOF-SW
           ELSE
               PERFORM 7-60-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.

       7-6-PROCESS-A-REC.
           MOVE BUF-DRELTRAK        TO  SORT-REC.
           RELEASE SORT-REC FROM BUF-DRELTRAK.
           PERFORM 7-60-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.

       7-60-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.
           READ DRELTRAK-I NEXT INTO BUF-DRELTRAK
               AT END MOVE "Y"     TO DRELTRAK-EOF-SW.
      *-------- STOP READING FILE IF MONTHLY REPORT AND NO MORE RECORDS
      *-------- FOR THAT MONTH EXIST.
           IF DRELTRAK-EOF-SW NOT = "Y"
               IF REPORT-TYPE = "M"
                   IF TREL-DATE-MM NOT = ARG-MM
                       MOVE "Y"    TO  DRELTRAK-EOF-SW.

       7-PROCESS-DRELTRAK-X.
           EXIT.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *              O U T P U T   P R O C E D U R E                   *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       8-PRINT-REPORT SECTION.
       8-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 8-1-HSK.
           PERFORM 8-6-PRINT-RECORDS
               UNTIL SORT-EOF-SW = "Y".
           GO TO 8-PRINT-REPORT-X.

       8-1-HSK.
           RETURN SORT-FILE INTO BUF-DRELTRAK
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO SORT-EOF-SW.
           IF SORT-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "****** NO RECORDS QUALIFIED FOR REPORT ******"
                                TO  REPORT-FILE-REC
               WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
               GO TO 8-PRINT-REPORT-X.

       8-6-PRINT-RECORDS.
           PERFORM 8-60-MOVE-FIELDS.
           PERFORM 8-61-WRITE-REPORT-LINE.
           RETURN SORT-FILE INTO BUF-DRELTRAK
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO SORT-EOF-SW.

       8-60-MOVE-FIELDS.
           INITIALIZE DETAIL-LINE.
           MOVE TREL-PO            TO  DET-PO.
           MOVE TREL-RLSE          TO  DET-RLSE.
           MOVE "-"                TO  HYPH-1.
           MOVE TREL-ITEM-NUM      TO  DET-ITEM.
           MOVE TREL-CODE          TO  DET-CODE.
           MOVE 4                  TO  DATE-MODE.
           MOVE TREL-DATE-YMD      TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT     TO  DET-DATE.
           MOVE TREL-USER-NAME     TO  DET-USER.
           MOVE TREL-PRICE         TO  DET-PRICE.
           MOVE TREL-PRICE-UM      TO  DET-UM.
           MOVE TREL-VENDOR        TO  DET-VENDOR.
           MOVE TREL-LOW-PO-NUM    TO  DET-LOW-PO.
           MOVE TREL-LOW-ITEM-NUM  TO  DET-LOW-ITEM.
           MOVE TREL-LOW-PRICE     TO  DET-LOW-PRICE.
           MOVE TREL-LOW-UM        TO  DET-LOW-UM.
           MOVE TREL-LOW-VENDOR    TO  DET-LOW-VENDOR.

       8-61-WRITE-REPORT-LINE.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           ADD 1                 TO  NUM-LINES.
           IF NUM-LINES > 55
               PERFORM 8-62-PRINT-HEADINGS.

       8-62-PRINT-HEADINGS.
           ADD 1                 TO  PAGE-NUM.
           MOVE PAGE-NUM         TO  H2-PAGE-NUM.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM HEADING-1 AFTER ADVANCING PAGE.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM HEADING-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM HEADING-3 AFTER ADVANCING 2.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM HEADING-4 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE REPORT-FILE-REC FROM HEADING-5 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE 5                TO  NUM-LINES.

       8-PRINT-REPORT-X.
           EXIT.

